&lt;p&gt;Ping’s Identity for AI solution is already in the market and gaining strong traction with global enterprises. Working across product, engineering, sales, and go-to-market teams, you’ll help deliver innovative capabilities that solve real customer challenges. You’ll partner with teams across Ping that move fast, listen closely, and obsess over user value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Product Manager role is an important part of Ping Identity’s worldwide go to market strategy. Reporting to the Group Product Manager for Identity for AI, you’ll drive product execution by defining requirements, managing the roadmap and backlog, and turning strategy into customer value. You’ll serve as the voice of the customer for engineering while providing product expertise and use-case guidance to the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ping, we’re using AI to accelerate delivery, improve decision-making, and increase effectiveness across the product lifecycle - giving you the opportunity to help shape how AI transforms product management itself.&lt;/p&gt;
